### Listar consultas
GET http://localhost:8082/appointments

### Agendar consulta para paciente existente (201)
POST http://localhost:8082/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 1,
  "doctorName": "Dr. Henrique Vasconcelos",
  "specialty": "Cardiologia",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-10-20T09:30:00",
  "notes": "Retorno anual"
}

### Agendar consulta para paciente inexistente (422)
POST http://localhost:8082/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 999,
  "doctorName": "Dra. Beatriz Campos",
  "specialty": "Dermatologia",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-10-21T14:00:00"
}

### Buscar consulta por id
GET http://localhost:8082/appointments/1

### Configuracao em uso
GET http://localhost:8082/appointments/info
